    "body": "Especially with `$all`. It seems `$all` has an implicit `\\n` newline or line break to it. I have disabled it all together for this very reason.\r\n\r\n`config.toml` \r\n\r\n```toml\r\nadd_newline = false\r\n\r\ncommand_timeout = 5000\r\n\r\nformat = \"$shell$status$character$username$sudo$hostname$directory$fill\\n\"\r\n\r\n[fill]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nstyle = \"bg:#595857 fg:#595857\"\r\nsymbol = \" \"\r\n\r\n[shell]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nbash_indicator = \"[ 🐃 ](bg:#f5f5dC)\"\r\nfish_indicator = \"[ 🐟 ](bg:#f5072c)\"\r\nxonsh_indicator = \"[ 🐍 ](bg:#f5072c)\"\r\nnu_indicator = \"[ 🦀 ](bg:#4585f5)\"\r\nstyle = \"bg:yellow fg:black\"\r\nformat = '[ 🐚 ](bg:#595857)[$indicator]($style)'\r\n\r\n[character]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"[ ✔ ](bg:green fg:#ffffff)\"\r\nerror_symbol = \"[ ✘ ](bg:red fg:#ffffff)\"\r\nformat = \"$symbol\"\r\n\r\n[status]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nstyle = \"bg:#ffffff fg:#000000 bold\"\r\nformat = '[ $status ]($style)'\r\n\r\n[username]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nstyle_user = \"bg:#967969 fg:#000000\"\r\nstyle_root = \"bg:red\"\r\nshow_always = true\r\nformat = '[ 👤 ](bg:#595857)[ $user ]($style)'\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nssh_only = false\r\nstyle = \"bg:#ccbeaa fg:#000000\"\r\nformat = \"[ 💻 ](bg:#595857 fg:#ffffff)[ $hostname ]($style)\"\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\n# truncation_length = 5\r\ntruncation_symbol = \"…\"\r\nread_only_style = \"197\"\r\nstyle = \"fg:#ffffff bg:#bf8484\"\r\nformat = '[ 🗂️ ](bg:#595857)[$read_only]($read_only_style)[ $path ]($style)'\r\n\r\n[directory.substitutions]\r\n\"~\" = \"🛖\"\r\n\"Documents\" = \"📄\"\r\n\"Downloads\" = \"📥\"\r\n\"Music\" = \"🎜\"\r\n\"Pictures\" = \"📷\"\r\n\r\n[sudo]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nsymbol = \" ! \"\r\nstyle = \"bg:red fg:#ffffff\"\r\nformat = \"[$symbol]($style)[ sudo ](bg:#ffffff fg:#000000)[ ✔ ](bg:red fg:#ffffff)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\nI am trying to achieve a tab bar like look\r\n\r\n![2022-10-01_22-40](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10971185/193419522-4601a13e-0f9c-4241-845e-f638edcdfc4d.png)\r\n![2022-10-01_22-42](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10971185/193419524-1bfe54ed-7df4-4028-be56-40a1c3229c17.png)\r\n",
